 <div class="lead rv" id="free">
  <span class="px">Free</span>
  <h3>Not ready yet? Get the 7 rules that save me the most credits.</h3>
  <p>Plus my character-lock prompt that keeps the same face in every shot. Free, straight to your inbox.</p>
  <form class="wl" id="lead" novalidate>
   <input type="email" id="lead-email" placeholder="your@email.com" autocomplete="email" required>
   <button class="btn hot" id="lead-btn" type="submit">Send me the rules</button>
   <div class="ok" id="lead-ok">Sent. Check your inbox (and Promotions).</div>
   <div class="fine">One email now, rare updates later. Reply "stop" anytime. <a href="https://playbook.zeromrr.club/playbook-privacy">Privacy</a></div>
  </form>
 </div>
